---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import PhilosophyImg from './assets/Philosophy.webp'

interface Props {
  title?: string
}

const { title = 'Our Philosophy' } = Astro.props
---
<section class="our-philosophy py-24 px-6 bg-black">
  <div
    class="max-w-containerBrand m-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center"
  >
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
      <h2 class="rs-philosophy-title font-bold text-[#F7F6F4]">
        {title}
      </h2>

      <div class="rs-philosophy-text flex flex-col gap-6 text-[#F7F6F4]">
        <p>
          For us, investing is like farming! Plant a seed in good soil, suitable environment, water
          it, give it time and at some point, you'll be reaping harvest every year! Time is our best
          friend in investing - play the long game and start early. Don't put all your eggs in one
          basket! DIVERSIFY! Some investments will give you cash flow, some will give you capital
          gains, it all adds up.
        </p>
        <p>
          At the start, a larger percentage of your investments should be in regulated entities
          (you'll know what that is when you join us) - you are in it for the long haul. Every
          investment opportunity must make sense in simple english, we avoid convoluted and
          illogical opportunities. Your money journey is one that will last your whole life time,
          take yourself seriously, mentally prepare for the ups, downs and opportunities they will
          present - your future self will thank you.
        </p>
        <p>
          Finally, Return is always a reward for risk! For most opportunities, the higher the
          return, the higher the risk! Know this and know peace!
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative">
      <Image
        src={PhilosophyImg}
        alt="Financial professional writing on a board"
        class="rounded-2xl w-full h-auto object-cover shadow-sm"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use '@/styles/fn.scss' as fn;

  .rs-philosophy-title {
    font-size: fn.useResponsiveSize(320, 1024, 32, 56);
    font-family: bold;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .rs-philosophy-text {
    font-size: fn.useResponsiveSize(320, 1024, 15, 18);
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-family: var(--font-family);
  }
  h2 {
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 1023px) {
    .our-philosophy {
      text-align: center;
      .rs-philosophy-title {
        margin-inline: auto;
      }
    }
  }
</style>
